[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303809620","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110620#issuecomment-3303809620","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110620","id":3303809620,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E7CJU","user":{"login":"AlexandraMercier","id":9421924,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MjE5MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9421924?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexandraMercier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexandraMercier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T16:45:47Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T16:45:47Z","body":"I don't know much about Zorin OS, but from wikipedia it looks like it's based on Ubuntu.  I do not seem to have crashes on archlinux.\n\nThe issue needs extra info. \n\n### Enabling Logging\nFirst, can you enable the file logging in your game's project settings? It should be under General -> Debug -> File Logging. I also provided an image since I only have the names in english.\n<img width=\"1208\" height=\"727\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a5697b3-63be-46b2-8918-2fe6079e2d56\" />\nThis will print error messages and debug message in the log path in the settings, and help to know what happens before the crash.\n\n### Information about Download\nYou mentioned downloading godot to have the most up to date version. How did you install it? Did you download the zip from Godot's official website? In my experience package managers can sometimes have issues (In my case, godot 4.5 is not yet available in archlinux's package manager so I downloaded it from zip instead). \n\n### Isolating other factors\nHave you tried creating an empty project to see if it crashes? From the video I see 3 different scenes, but there seems to be more. Was the project created with 4.4 then migrated to 4.5?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303809620/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3304373587","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110620#issuecomment-3304373587","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110620","id":3304373587,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E9L1T","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/